00:12:58.710 --> 00:13:01.843
So if we switch back
to the demo machine,

00:13:01.843 --> 00:13:03.260
I'm just going to
real quick setup

00:13:03.260 --> 00:13:05.820
a new firewall rule
on this machine.

00:13:05.820 --> 00:13:09.460
So what I'm going to do
here is in the console,

00:13:09.460 --> 00:13:14.460
I'm going to go over to VPC
network, firewall rules,

00:13:14.460 --> 00:13:17.100
and we'll create a new rule.

00:13:17.100 --> 00:13:20.030
Let's go ahead and do that.

00:13:20.030 --> 00:13:21.750
You'll see that
