00:13:21.750 --> 00:13:25.060
Let's call it MySQL.

00:13:25.060 --> 00:13:28.000
It's got to be lowercase, mysql.

00:13:28.000 --> 00:13:29.100
We can turn on log.

00:13:29.100 --> 00:13:30.860
So I'm just going to leave it.

00:13:30.860 --> 00:13:32.180
Ingress, allow/deny.

00:13:32.180 --> 00:13:37.560
And we're going to call
the target tag MySQL.

00:13:37.560 --> 00:13:44.290
And we will specify 3306.

00:13:44.290 --> 00:13:46.200
Great.

00:13:46.200 --> 00:13:48.450
And I'm just going to
